<div class="page-body">

  <div class="page-intro">
    <strong>Plain-English Summary:</strong> We collect only what we need to pick up and deliver your laundry. We don't sell your information. We don't share it with marketers. We use it to run your orders and communicate with you. That's it.
  </div>

  <div class="page-section">
    <div class="page-section-num">Section 01</div>
    <h2 class="page-section-title">Who We Are</h2>
    <p>Thread &amp; Oak Laundry Co. is a laundry pickup and delivery service based in Morrisville, NC, currently serving both Cary and Morrisville, NC. We are a locally owned and operated small business.</p>
    <p>This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you use our services or interact with our website at threadandoak.com.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="page-section">
    <div class="page-section-num">Section 02</div>
    <h2 class="page-section-title">Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We collect only the information necessary to provide our laundry pickup and delivery service. This includes:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Contact information</strong> — your name, phone number, and email address</li>
      <li><strong>Service address</strong> — your pickup and delivery location</li>
      <li><strong>Scheduling preferences</strong> — your preferred pickup windows and recurring schedule</li>
      <li><strong>Laundry preferences</strong> — detergent preferences, folding instructions, special care notes</li>
      <li><strong>Payment information</strong> — billing details processed securely through our payment providers. We do not store full credit card numbers.</li>
      <li><strong>Service history</strong> — records of past orders to improve your experience</li>
    </ul>
 <p>When you visit our website, certain technical information may be collected automatically, such as IP address, browser type, device information, pages visited, and timestamps. This may be collected by our website host, security tools, analytics providers, or embedded services used to operate the website.</p>

<p>Please do not provide sensitive personal information unless it is necessary for us to complete your laundry order. If you provide allergy, fragrance sensitivity, detergent sensitivity, or special-care information, we use it only to fulfill your service preferences.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="page-section">
    <div class="page-section-num">Section 03</div>
    <h2 class="page-section-title">How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>Your information is used solely to operate and improve our service. Specifically:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>To schedule, confirm, and complete your laundry pickups and deliveries</li>
      <li>To send you text and email notifications about your order status</li>
      <li>To process payment for services rendered</li>
      <li>To remember your preferences for future orders</li>
      <li>To respond to questions, concerns, or service issues</li>
      <li>To improve our routes, timing, and service quality</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="page-highlight">
      <p><strong>We will never use your information to:</strong> sell your information to third-party marketers, send unsolicited promotional messages from other companies, or build advertising profiles about you.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="page-section">
    <div class="page-section-num">Section 04</div>
    <h2 class="page-section-title">How We Share Your Information</h2>
    <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. Period.</p>
    <p>We may share limited information with trusted third parties only as necessary to operate our service:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Processing partners</strong> — our laundry facility partners receive only what they need to process your order. They do not receive your full contact details or address.</li>
      <li><strong>Delivery partners</strong> — if we use approved delivery contractors or service providers, they receive only the information reasonably necessary to complete pickup or delivery, such as your first name, service address, and order instructions.</li>
      <li><strong>Payment processors</strong> — your payment details are handled by PCI-compliant payment processors. We never see or store your full card number.</li>
      <li><strong>Legal requirements</strong> — we may disclose information if required by law, court order, or to protect the safety of our customers or staff.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="page-section">
  <div class="page-section-num">Section 05</div>
  <h2 class="page-section-title">Text &amp; Email Communications</h2>

  <p>By providing your phone number and scheduling service with Thread &amp; Oak Laundry Co., you agree to receive service-related text messages and emails, including pickup confirmations, delivery updates, account notices, and service-related communications. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out of non-essential text messages or HELP for assistance.</p>

  <p>Marketing and promotional messages are optional and are not required to purchase services. If you choose to receive marketing or promotional messages, you may opt out at any time by replying STOP or contacting us at <a href="mailto:info@threadandoak.com">info@threadandoak.com</a>.</p>

  <p>We do not sell your phone number, email address, or messaging opt-in information to third parties.</p>
</div>

  <div class="page-section">
    <div class="page-section-num">Section 06</div>
    <h2 class="page-section-title">Data Security</h2>
    <p>We take reasonable measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, disclosure, or misuse. Our website is served over HTTPS with SSL encryption. Payment processing is handled by PCI-compliant providers.</p>
    <p>As a small local business, we store customer information in secured systems accessible only to Thread &amp; Oak staff. We do not maintain large databases of sensitive financial information.</p>
    <p>No method of data transmission or storage is 100% secure. In the unlikely event of a data breach affecting your personal information, we will notify affected customers as required by applicable law.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="page-section">
    <div class="page-section-num">Section 07</div>
    <h2 class="page-section-title">Data Retention</h2>
    <p>We retain your personal information for as long as you are an active customer and for a reasonable period afterward to resolve any disputes, process final payments, or comply with legal obligations.</p>
    <p>If you request deletion of your account and personal data, we will honor that request within 30 days, subject to any legal retention requirements.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="page-section">
    <div class="page-section-num">Section 08</div>
    <h2 class="page-section-title">Your Rights</h2>
    <p>You have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Request a copy of the personal information we hold about you</li>
      <li>Request correction of inaccurate information</li>
      <li>Request deletion of your personal information</li>
      <li>Opt out of non-essential communications at any time</li>
      <li>Ask how your data is being used</li>
    </ul>
    <p>To exercise any of these rights, contact us at info@threadandoak.com or 919-435-4608. We will respond within 10 business days.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="page-section">
    <div class="page-section-num">Section 09</div>
    <h2 class="page-section-title">Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>Our services are intended for adults 18 years of age and older. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us immediately and we will delete it.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="page-section">
    <div class="page-section-num">Section 10</div>
    <h2 class="page-section-title">Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted to this page with an updated effective date. For material changes, we will make reasonable efforts to notify active customers by email or text.</p>
    <p>Continued use of our services after any changes constitutes your acceptance of the updated policy.</p>
  </div>

